  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact Advisory to Wavemaker_Development Services Agreement</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Wavemaker Partners, a multi-faceted cross border venture capital firm undertakes a new initiative, Wavemaker impact (WMi), focused on investing in and building impact-focused ventures targeting: (i) SDG 7: Affordable and clean energy; (ii) SDG 9: Industry, Innovation &amp; Infrastructure; (iii) SDG 11: Sustainable Cities and Communities and (iv) SDG 13: Climate Action. As part of this, WMi will develop a venture incubation facility to launch up to 12-15 impact focused start-ups over the next 3 years</narrative>
  </description>
